# Private planning, agent tooling, and local scratch. These were previously ignored
# only through .git/info/exclude, which is per-clone and per-machine: a fresh clone
# had no protection at all, so the first `git add` there would have committed them.
# They are tracked here so the rule travels with the repository.
/research/
/design-analysis-*.md
/norfold-ui-audit.md

